msgctxt "68\t148"
msgid "Things aren't lookin' so hot, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "149\t223"
msgid "You're dang right they're not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228\t365"
msgid ""
"I did some figuring, and we're really\\n"
"gonna have to start scrimpin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "398\t496"
msgid "Sucks how quick they spring those rent hikes on ya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "497\t655"
msgid ""
"Can't forget the food bill either.\\n"
"Everyone eats truckloads."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656\t775"
msgid "We can't afford to spend another yen, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776\t901"
msgid ""
"Next month's rent's gonna be tight.\\n"
"Way too tight for comfort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "902\t962"
msgid "I get it, I get it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980\t1043"
msgid "But what can we do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1044\t1101"
msgid "What'd Kiryu-aniki have to say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1102\t1218"
msgid ""
"Didn't tell him.\\n"
"I don't want him worryin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1267\t1411"
msgid "Then, maybe if we... chip in⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1412\t1566"
msgid ""
"Dumbass! We can't help if\\n"
"we can barely support ourselves!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1568\t1642"
msgid "Guess so, huh."
msgstr ""